        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KG5tNVd0oSbwpklW5QODz8XZ3tw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87305-MicrowavePopcorn-ddmfs-step-1-3804-4x3-c3470dfb2e1f4bcfba4f367c3242addf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87305/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together unpopped popcorn and oil in a cup or small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GmPBGT2P4KgB6T_tHy-aF9MPNt0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87305-MicrowavePopcorn-ddmfs-step-2-3808-4x3-761daa449d2a43c08532510fc98e5f66.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87305/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the coated corn into a brown paper lunch sack, and sprinkle in the salt. Fold the top of the bag over twice to seal in the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pqzsE3DUHJ22wCGdjn7r73Ih390=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/304-MicrowavePopcorn-ddmfs-step-3-3811-4x3-a1491e3bdb2649559d186b331f4e60a7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87305/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the microwave at full power for 2 1/2 to 3 minutes, or until you hear pauses of about 2 seconds between pops. Carefully open the bag to avoid steam, and pour into a serving bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
